  (junction
    (at 219.71 165.1)
    (diameter 0)
    (color 0 0 0 0)
    (uuid "c9dc0531-6cd5-42e5-8cc8-e7e9908a8345")
  )
  (text "J1 POWERBOARD CONNECTOR - JST-XH 8P\n  1-2 +5V   3-4 +3V3   5-6 GND   7 PWR_UART_TX   8 PWR_UART_RX (order to confirm with powerboard)\nQ1 blocks a reversed 5V input. D9/D10 absorb surges.\nF2/F3 PTC fuses open on a sustained short. No undervoltage or overvoltage cut-off (kept simple).\nWhy these parts and values: DESIGN_NOTES.md §3. Open issues M1-M3."
    (at 156.21 279.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "eaa74447-9623-4586-af7e-f48d3f6c5ebc")
  )
  (text "USB VBUS INPUT\nF1 PTC fuse (sheet 03) opens on a cable or board short. D12 at J2 absorbs surges.\nC55 meets the USB minimum VBUS capacitance. No inrush limiter.\nDetails: DESIGN_NOTES.md §4."
    (at 115.57 238.76 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "d3fe3c7f-cb5b-4212-85ed-b97fc23b0f6b")
  )
  (text "LIMITS\nNo overvoltage cut-off on the powerboard rails: the powerboard must regulate (M1, M2).\nThe TVS diodes only take surges. PTC fuses are slow; they protect wiring and connectors.\nDetails: DESIGN_NOTES.md §3 and §13."
    (at 223.52 248.92 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "a1393490-7732-48d7-a6d6-92c33f0f3444")
  )
  (text "ROUTING - POWER INPUT\nJ1 -> Q1/D9/D10 -> F2/F3 -> U1/U2: 2A traces, >=1.0mm on 1oz outer (or pours).\nQ1, D9 and D10 right at J1 (D9 stays after Q1). Short wide GND via at each TVS.\nC1/C2/C7 at TPS2116 VIN, C3/C8 at VOUT.\nU3 tab to a copper pour. R46/R47 near J1, UART pair away from the power pours."
    (at 240.03 68.58 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 255 0 0 1)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "7918ee8b-1686-43e5-baee-b69f4b344b9a")
  )
  (text "R1/R2: 5V source switchover point\n(DESIGN_NOTES.md §4)"
    (at 243.84 121.92 0)
    (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "df526cc9-9a6a-40bf-b270-4bc6a9a279ee")
  )
  (text "R3/R4: 3V3 source switchover point\n(DESIGN_NOTES.md §4)"
    (at 243.84 182.88 0)
    (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "cce8de1d-3050-4c3b-b01a-9c1b24ff931c")
  )
  (text "POWERBOARD CONNECTOR J1"
    (at 17.78 60.96 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.4) (bold yes) (color 0 0 132 1)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "eba1d35b-53c5-487d-9121-8b8956a4eb76")
  )
  (text "5V INPUT: Q1 REVERSE POLARITY, D9 TVS, F2 FUSE"
    (at 100.33 77.47 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.4) (bold yes) (color 0 0 132 1)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "86734f9c-4944-4910-8e69-63360ddcaa62")
  )
  (text "5V MUX U1: POWERBOARD, ELSE USB"
    (at 241.3 77.47 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.4) (bold yes) (color 0 0 132 1)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "6a54e356-fccd-4b74-8a72-37e7bd842db2")
  )
  (text "3V3 INPUT: D10 TVS, F3 FUSE"
    (at 81.28 151.13 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.4) (bold yes) (color 0 0 132 1)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "c656a3c7-c368-4776-8b56-0fc72e1f128e")
  )
  (text "3V3 MUX U2: POWERBOARD, ELSE USB LDO"
    (at 241.3 148.59 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.4) (bold yes) (color 0 0 132 1)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "92b19831-ffc6-4ade-9d18-2d37f79039e4")
  )
  (text "USB VBUS AND 3V3 LDO U3"
    (at 40.64 196.85 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.4) (bold yes) (color 0 0 132 1)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "16e0dd19-30b6-4064-952d-214b9fd9cb3b")
  )
  (text "POWER MUX - U1/U2 TPS2116, priority mode\nPowerboard (VIN1) is used whenever present; USB (VIN2) is the bench fallback.\nNo output diodes needed: the TPS2116 blocks reverse current into an unused input.\nST tells the MCU which source is active (PWR_SRC_5V/3V3). R83 protects PA2 from the bootloader.\nThe radio (J14, +3V3) and DotStars (+5V) run from the mux outputs, so they also draw from USB.\nDetails: DESIGN_NOTES.md §2 and §4. Sag at switchover with USB attached: M7."
    (at 33.02 279.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "7f1dff67-4aad-42b0-a332-56d6e98c3926")
  )
